WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.2 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
From Theory of Change to results framework

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A results framework turns your Theory of Change into a table you can monitor.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Copy only the results you will actually monitor.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Keep the codes: ESO1, Outcome 1.1, Output 1.1.1.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check that each level leads to the next.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Outcome 1.2: trainees earn the certificate and get formal job offers within three months. Evidence: certificate results, follow-up calls.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a results framework for one external objective.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
